---
description: Defines how to store and retrieve session data with Upstash Redis. `@vercel/kv` is deprecated.
globs: "**/*.ts"
---
- Use `@upstash/redis` to store and retrieve session data.
- Create the client with `Redis.fromEnv()`, which reads `UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL` and `UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN`.
- Utilize `redis.set`, `redis.get`, and `redis.del` to manage data.
- Ensure the database operations are asynchronous to avoid blocking server-side rendering (SSR).